        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "最初から暴力を振るったのではありません。深夜、窓の外に佇むことから始まりました。",
          "characters_spoken": 40,
          "est_dur_s": 6.24,
          "src_script": "2.05#2 · 2.05#3 · 5.07#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_open_window",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "第1段階は深夜の覗き見。闇に潜み、窓越しに女性たちの私生活を監視しました。",
          "characters_spoken": 37,
          "est_dur_s": 6.29,
          "src_script": "2.05#2 · 2.05#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_drawer_dark",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "第2段階は留守宅侵入。金品には触れず、女性たちの下着や私物だけを持ち去りました。",
          "characters_spoken": 40,
          "est_dur_s": 6.8,
          "src_script": "2.05#4 · 2.05#8 · 2.05#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_folder_tree",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "儀式は全件で同一：写真を撮り、品を持ち去り、克明に記録を残すのです。",
          "characters_spoken": 34,
          "est_dur_s": 5.78,
          "src_script": "2.05#10"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_brain_neural",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "行動が日常化すると妄想の飢餓に陥り、快感を再現するためにより高いリスクを冒します。",
          "characters_spoken": 41,
          "est_dur_s": 7.18,
          "src_script": "3.05#7 · 3.05#8 · 3.05#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_open_window",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "第3段階：2009年9月、住人が在宅中の民家へ押し入り、拘束に及びました。",
          "characters_spoken": 37,
          "est_dur_s": 6.29,
          "src_script": "2.05#11 · 2.05#12 · 2.05#13"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_two_chairs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "そして第4段階：2009年11月、基地所属の37歳伍長Marie-France Comeauの命を強奪。",
          "characters_spoken": 51,
          "est_dur_s": 8.67,
          "src_script": "2.05#14 · 2.05#15"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_house_missing",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "わずか2カ月後、次の犠牲となったのがJessica Lloydでした。",
          "characters_spoken": 34,
          "est_dur_s": 5.3,
          "src_script": "2.05#16"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#10",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_oath_hall",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "2009年7月の基地司令官昇進が引き金でした：絶対的権力と重圧が、最後のブレーキを破壊したのです。",
          "characters_spoken": 49,
          "est_dur_s": 8.59,
          "src_script": "1.03#4 · 3.05#10"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "犯罪は殺人から始まるのではありません。処罰されなかった覗き見から始まるのです。",
          "characters_spoken": 39,
          "est_dur_s": 6.08,
          "src_script": "5.07#5 · 5.07#6"
        },
